# Rust build artifacts
engine/target/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The kitty source tree is NOT part of this repository.
#
# It is 100% regenerable from kitty-patches/ + kitty-overlay/ applied to the
# pinned upstream tarball (see README.en.md), so vendoring 220 MB of it here
# would only create a second, drifting copy of upstream. Materialise it with:
#
#     ./scripts/moss-apply-patches.sh /path/to/kitty-X.Y.Z && mv ... ./kitty
#
# Note the leading slashes: these anchor to the repository root so that
# kitty-overlay/kitty/ (which IS tracked) is not swept up too.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/kitty/
/kitty.prev/
/kitty-pristine/
/kitty-*.tar.xz
/kitty-*.tar.gz

# Source-tarball output (scripts/make-source-tarball.sh)
/dist/

# kitty build artifacts — kept for anyone who has an older checkout in which
# kitty/ is still tracked; redundant once /kitty/ above applies.
kitty/build/
kitty/linux-package/
kitty/kitty/launcher/kitty
kitty/kitty/launcher/kitten
kitty/**/*.so
kitty/**/*_generated.go
kitty/**/*_generated.h
kitty/**/*_generated.s
kitty/**/*_generated.bin
kitty/glfw/wayland-*-protocol.c
kitty/glfw/wayland-*-protocol.h
kitty/fonts/
kitty/docs/generated/
kitty/compile_commands.json
kitty/link_commands.json
kitty/*.log

# sync workdir and previous tree kept by moss-sync-kitty.sh --adopt
.sync-work/
kitty.prev/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# secrets must never enter the repo
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
kitty/.moss-patched
.moss-patched
*.orig
*.rej

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal development scaffolding (agent prompts, ad-hoc test logs). These are
# notes to the people building this project, not product documentation, and
# scripts/make-source-tarball.sh already keeps them out of release tarballs.
#
# The 14 that predate this rule are ALREADY TRACKED, so ignoring them here has
# no effect until they are untracked. To drop them from the public repo:
#     git rm --cached -- *提示词.md 实施指南.md 工具规则.md 全面测试异常清单.md
# (that keeps your local copies; only the index entry goes away).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*提示词.md
/实施指南.md
/工具规则.md
/全面测试异常清单.md

# editors / OS
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
